  "slug": "get-married",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/15170_get-married.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A: I’m getting married on the 8th of next month. Come to Nanhu Hotel to attend my wedding.",
    "B: Congratulations! I didn't expect you to get married so soon. What day of the week is the 8th?",
    "A: The 8th should be Saturday.",
    "B: No problem on Saturday, I’ll have a rest. I will prepare a big red envelope for you when the time comes. I am so happy for you!",
    "A: Thank you, thank you! And you? When are you going to get married?",
    "B: Me? After breaking up with you, I still don’t have another girlfriend. Maybe I don’t want to meet other girls anymore.",
    "A: Don’t be like this... We have been separated for three years. Let's start a new life, okay?",
    "B: It’s okay, as long as you live a happy life. Knowing that you are happy makes me happy.",
    "A: You also want to be happy!"
  ],
  "english_full": "A: I’m getting married on the 8th of next month. Come to Nanhu Hotel to attend my wedding.\n\nB: Congratulations! I didn't expect you to get married so soon. What day of the week is the 8th?\n\nA: The 8th should be Saturday.\n\nB: No problem on Saturday, I’ll have a rest. I will prepare a big red envelope for you when the time comes. I am so happy for you!\n\nA: Thank you, thank you! And you? When are you going to get married?\n\nB: Me? After breaking up with you, I still don’t have another girlfriend. Maybe I don’t want to meet other girls anymore.\n\nA: Don’t be like this... We have been separated for three years. Let's start a new life, okay?\n\nB: It’s okay, as long as you live a happy life. Knowing that you are happy makes me happy.\n\nA: You also want to be happy!",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "А: Я жени́тся 8-го сле́дующего ме́сяца. Приходи́те в оте́ль Наньху́, чтобы посети́ть мою сва́дьбу.",
    "Б: Мои́ поздравле́ния! Я не ожида́л, что ты жа́ скоро вы́йдешь за́муж. Какой день неде́ли 8-е?",
    "А: 8-е, да́ должно быть, суббо́та.",
    "Б: В суббо́ту нет пробле́м, я буду отдыхать. Я подгото́влю большо́й красный конве́рт для тебя́, когда́ на́станет вре́мя. Я о́чень рад за тебя́!",
    "А: Спаси́бо, спаси́бо! А ты? Когда́ ты собира́ешься жени́ться?",
    "Б: Я? По́сле разло́ма с тобо́й я все е́щё не име́ю друго́й возлю́бленной. Возмо́жно, я не хочу́ встреча́ть друго́их дево́нок бо́льше.",
    "А: Не будь тако́им... Мы оста́лись порознь три́ года. Давáйте начнём но́вую жи́знь, хорошо́?",
    "Б: Всё в по́рядке, е́сли ты живёшь счастли́вой жи́знью. Зная́, что ты счáстлив, делает меня́ счáстливым.",
    "А: Ты тоже́ хочешь быть счáстливым!"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "A: YA zhenítsa 8-go sléduyushchego mésyatsa. Prikhodite v otél Nanýkhu, chtoby posetít' moyu svádbu.",
    "B: Moí pozdrávleniya! YA ne ozhidál, chto ty zhá skoro výydesh' zámuzh. Kakoy den' nedéli 8-e?",
    "A: 8-e, dá dolzhno byt', subbóta.",
    "B: V subbótu net problém, YA budu ótdykhat'. YA podgotov́лю bol'shóy krasnýy konvért dlya tebá, kogdá nastanet vreḿya. YA óchyen rad za tebá!",
    "A: Spaśibo, spaśibo! A ty? Kogdá ty sobiráesh'sya zhenít'sya?",
    "B: YA? Posle razlóma s tóboy YA vse éshcho ne iméyoo drugóy vozlúblennoy. Vozmózhno, YA ne khóchyu vstréchat' drugóikh devónok ból'she.",
    "A: Ne bud' takóim... My ostális' porozh' trí goda. Daváyte nach́ném nóvuyu zhízn', khoroshó?",
    "B: Vsyo v porýadke, esli ty zhivёsh' schastliv́oy zhiźnyu. Znáya, chto ty shchastliv́, delayet menyá shchastliv́ym.",
    "A: Ty tózhe khóchesh' byt' shchastliv́ym!"
  ],
